<title>USA: Del Global Technologies Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Del Global Technologies Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>VALHALLA, N.Y. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>(UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>			Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>		     May 3,	 Apr 27,     May 3,	Apr 27,</p>
<p>			1997	    1996	  1997	  1996</p>
